{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00837","headline":"郊庙歌辞 晋朝飨乐章 羣臣酒行歌 一 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 晋朝飨乐章 羣臣酒行歌 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"劒佩俨如林，齐倾拱北心。\n渥恩颁美禄，咸濩听和音。\n一德君臣合，重瞳日月临。\n歌时兼乐圣，唯待赞泥金。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00837.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00837","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}